          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Each time a model in this unit targets an enemy unit with a melee attack, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If that enemy unit is within range of an objective marker, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead.</characteristic>
